@startuml
' DYS Financial Management System (DYS FMS)
' Case Study #4 — Activity Diagram: Current Business Process (As-Is)
' Version 11.0 — Single top-to-bottom flow, clean merges, shared operational note
' Notation: UML 2.x Activity Diagram with Swimlanes

skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2B2B2B
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #2B2B2B
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #555555
skinparam ArrowColor #2B2B2B
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C2C27A
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold

title DYS Event Management — Current Business Process (As-Is)

|Employees / Event Staff|
|Manager/Head|
|Business Owner|
|Bookkeeper|

|Business Owner|
start
:Business transaction occurs\nacross business sector;
note right
  Sectors: DYS Events, B&DYS,
  Flavors by DYS, SnapDYS Memories
end note

:Determine transaction type;

if (Transaction type?) is (Sales) then
  :Receive sales details\nor keep handwritten notes;
  :Forward sales info\nto Bookkeeper;
  |Bookkeeper|
  :Record sales\nin ledger;
  |Business Owner|
else (Expense)
  |Employees / Event Staff|
  :Purchase supplies and\nrecord expense details;
  note right
    Performed by Employees/Event Staff
    or Manager/Head when assigned
  end note
  :Send expense details and\nreceipt via Messenger;
  |Business Owner|
  :Receive expense info\nand receipt;
  if (Forward to\nBookkeeper?) is (yes) then
    :Forward expense\nto Bookkeeper;
    |Bookkeeper|
    :Record expense\nin ledger;
    |Business Owner|
  else (no)
    :Keep in personal notes;
    note right
      Risk: forgotten expenses\nor lost receipts
    end note
  endif
endif

:Review manual records\nacross disparate sources;

|Manager/Head|
:Supervise employees/event staff;
note right
  Separate responsibility
  (not per-transaction)
end note
:Review financial reports\nwithin assigned sector range;

|Business Owner|
:Manually calculate salary\n(Hours x Hourly Rate);
:Financial information remains\nacross notes, receipts,\nMessenger, and ledger;
stop
@enduml
